		{"id":"be4eef87bea12a3e","type":"text","text":"## markdown structure for updates and reports\n\n### summary of above content\n\n< summary > \n### Full information\n\n< content fetched >\n\n","x":730,"y":-580,"width":380,"height":380},
		{"id":"9069328107855202","type":"text","text":"### Current path for EK\nfetch -> azure -> index -> postgres(reference)","x":730,"y":-740,"width":380,"height":80},
		{"id":"8ca63f18b62db6dd","type":"text","text":"## athena road map\n\n* Website - landing page\n* Enter Athena\n\t* Signup\n\t\t* **Signup**\n\t\t\t* Valid inputs like\n\t\t\t\t* Name \n\t\t\t\t* org name\n\t\t\t\t* email\n\t\t\t\t* number\n\t\t\t\t* password\n\t\t\t\t* confirm password\n\t\t\t* **Create contributor account**\n\t\t\t\t* as it is first time ask for\n\t\t\t\t\t* Org on boarding questions\n\t\t\t\t* creates sub contributor accounts\n\t\t\t* **Sub contributors** \n\t\t\t\t* need to think\n","x":-1329,"y":-700,"width":560,"height":620},
		{"id":"93255639853076ff","type":"text","text":"## On-boarding Organisation: \n\n* Create organisation\n* Knowledge of the organisation\n\t* org docs\n\t\t* vision\n\t\t* policy\n\t\t* etc,.\n\t* store it in the azure blob","x":-670,"y":-780,"width":520,"height":410},
		{"id":"5365f79ef7ed7276","type":"text","text":"## current scope\n\n**Integration:**\n* azure blob - vector database (onbording (vision, policy)) - replacing onedrive with azure blob\n* Teams - azure to vector database\n* goodday - postgres\n\n## future scope\n\n**Integration:**\n* outlook\n* calendar. ","x":-1329,"y":-1150,"width":560,"height":410},
		{"id":"8c7f43ebaba672a0","type":"text","text":"**teams channels mapping?** \n\n**do not remove calendar and outlook tabs restore them**\n\n**replace summary of above content to only summary.** \n","x":3271,"y":-570,"width":400,"height":240},
		{"id":"0612dc233855e486","type":"text","text":"![[Pasted image 20260804123106.png]]","x":3691,"y":-570,"width":339,"height":240},
		{"id":"5ec7f5647c119bc6","type":"text","text":"azurite storage structure: \n\n**everything should be in md format.** \n* Enterprise Knowledge/\n\t* Reports and updates/\n\t\t* daily/ \n\t\t* weekly/( hold )\n\t\t* monthly/ (hold)\n\t* Product Knowledge/ ( hold - onboarding )\n\t\t* vision\n\t\t* policy\n\t\t* goals\n\n---\n\n* Outlook has knowledge of:\n\t* folder name - Reports and updates\n\t\t* folder name - **weekly** \n\t\t\t* file name - week number with month and year\n\t\t\t\t* fetch all messages\n* Teams has knowledge of:\n\t* folder name - Reports and updates\n\t\t* folder name - **daily**\n\t\t\t* file name - date and group name\n\t\t\t\t* fetch all from that date\n* Calendar has knowledge of: \n\t* << keep it empty as of now >>","x":128,"y":-780,"width":560,"height":660},
		{"id":"e41ecdf613e2688a","type":"text","text":"## org tenant\n\n* Every org has id\n\t* org 1\n\t\t* every org has 1 pmo\n\t\t* one org must have only MS connected (project knowledge)\n\t\t\t* pmo\n\t\t\t\t* po 1\n\t\t\t\t* po 2\n\t\t\t\t* po 3\n\t* one project management tool\n\t* tool and athena account mapping\n\t* org 2\n\t\t* every org has 1 pmo\n\t\t\t* pmo \n\t\t\t\t* po 1\n\t\t\t\t* po 2\n\t\t\t\t* po 3\n\n\t* org 3\n\t\t* every org has 1 pmo\n\t\t\t* pmo \n\t\t\t\t* po 1\n\t\t\t\t* po 2\n\t\t\t\t* po 3","x":960,"y":-1625,"width":540,"height":692},
		{"id":"7087824ee3baa9bc","type":"text","text":"1. Customised MCP\n\t1. goodday\n\t2. MS serivces\n\t3. jira\n2. Current intelligence \n\t1. real time fetching\n3. Registry\n\t1. store data with approval\n\n","x":408,"y":-1418,"width":380,"height":279},
