		{"id":"850836e09e889faf","type":"text","text":"1. hirerachy\n\t1. default org data is getting leaked to new organisation \n\n**how do we set new organisation?**\n\n1. role mapping? \n\t1. After creating owner account(CEO), CEO will invite PMO\n\t2. no mapping between PMO athena account to project tool mapping\n\t\t1. PMO cannot map head quarter owners\n\t\t\t1. cannot fetch product related information.\n---\n**how org reflects?**\n\n2.  for information loading **what is the approach?** \n\n\n","x":270,"y":598,"width":500,"height":570,"color":"1"},
