		{
			"id":"cb148e813ca838d1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## mcp backlog (Aug 10th)\n\n![[Pasted image 20260810170100.png]]\n\n\n* Client ID and Client secret is currently hardcoded in  MCP application need to make it dynamic\n\t* for every microsoft account it should allow by providing its own client id and client secret. \n* currently for every time it is being bypassing by using **AIKruise** MS account client id and secret. ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-990,
			"y":3360,
			"width":1320,
			"height":940,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"f416bc8ccc4e4c47",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Ideal MCP and APP communication\n1. one time Application (example Athena) register with MCP toolkit\n  2. get the id and secretes for application (athena)\n3. using registered id's we request again to access the tools\n  4. ms teams\n  5. ms outlook\n  6. etc.\n  7. to access MS system we need Microsoft Client id and secretes from Entra by registering application\n    8. need to gain the 46 permission from company account admin (shivaraj has access. app register has to raise the permission)\n9. flow expected\n  10. when some tenant in athena wants to connect their company MS system has to go through\n    11. athea\n    12. then mcp tool kit\n    13. app registration with the microsoft entra\n    14. pass those values for the request",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":610,
			"y":3600,
			"width":920,
			"height":460
		},
		{
			"id":"1e3632a3147a2ecb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## first time user experience\n1. landing page \n\t1. to login\n\t2. feature single line middle alignment\n\t3. source connection animation https://dribbble.com/shots/25120082-SaaS-Integrations-Page-Design\n2. application\n\t1. first time user\n\t\t1. org signup with ceo account\n\t\t2. ceo login\n\t\t3. welcome note with PMO invite message and location\n\t\t4. PMO invite and Executive dashboard\n\t2. PMO login\n\t\t1. welcome note with headquater and enterprise knowledge creation hint also depart creation help\n\t\t2. source connection help\n\t\t\t  1. user comes from headquarer page\n\t\t\t  2. first time nothing in the page just says connect your sources. on click redirects to the settings page\n\t\t\t  3. user selects teams, outlook etc., logs in\n\t\t\t  4.  teams mapping page in settings\n\t\t\t\t  1. it will have go to enterprise button (modal after connection)\n ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2050,
			"y":3600,
			"width":1106,
			"height":600
		},
