			"text":"## demo plan for next phase (Aug 10 to Aug 15th)\n\n1. UI beautify\n\t1. structured table formats\n2. get the current state information\n3. show risks and gaps in the current state. \n4. show risks and gaps if a new work item is introduced. \n\t1. show gaps\n\t2. show risks\n\t3. show impacts\n",
