		{"id":"a9e9fa063e5c3ef4","type":"text","text":"azurite storage structure: \n\n**everything should be in md format in azure blob storage.** \n\n```\n.\n├── orgnaization-1/\n│   └── Enterprise_Knowledge/\n│       ├── company_knowledge\n│       ├── Enterprise_Memory\n│       └── Headquarters_Knowledge/\n│           └── HQ1(product, HR, Finance)/\n│               ├── Vision\n│               └── Department_Knlowedge (product-1)/\n│                   ├── vison\n│                   ├── owner\n│                   └── Reports/\n│                       ├── daily\n│                       ├── weekly\n│                       ├── monthly\n│                       ├── Quarterly\n│                       └── Yearly\n└── orgnaization-2/\n    └── Enterprise_Knowledge/\n        ├── company_knowledge\n        ├── Enterprise_Memory\n        └── Headquarters_Knowledge/\n            └── HQ1(product, HR, Finance)/\n                ├── Vision\n                └── Department_Knlowedge (product-1)/\n                    ├── vison\n                    ├── owner\n                    └── Reports/\n                        ├── daily\n                        ├── weekly\n                        ├── monthly\n                        ├── Quarterly\n                        └── Yearly\n\n```","x":-2360,"y":820,"width":560,"height":485},
