			"type":"text",
			"text":"## dummy org definition\n\n```\nAcme Organization\n       |\n       +-- Engineering HQ\n       |       |\n       |       +-- AI Department\n       |       +-- Platform Department\n       |       +-- Frontend Department\n       |\n       +-- Finance HQ\n       |       |\n       |       +-- Accounting Department\n       |       +-- Finance Operations Department\n       |\n       +-- Operations HQ\n               |\n               +-- HR Department\n               +-- Administration Department\n```",
